    "answer": {
      "short": "$13.2$ minutes",
      "worked": "Class centres: $2.5,\\ 7.5,\\ 12.5,\\ 17.5,\\ 25$ minutes.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum f&=3+8+21+16+2=50\\\\\\sum(cc\\times f)&=2.5(3)+7.5(8)+12.5(21)+17.5(16)+25(2)\\\\\\sum(cc\\times f)&=660\\\\\\bar t&=\\frac{660}{50}=13.2\\text{ minutes}\\end{align*}$$",
